-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §154: amounts whose updating follows teachers'
-- pay rises are updated for this agreement by agreement after negotiation;
-- failing agreement by 31.3.09, and in the supreme follow-up committee, each
-- side keeps its claims.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `154`

DECLARE `outcome of section 154` IS ONE OF
    `updated at the rate and dates agreed`
    `each side keeps its claims`
    `still under negotiation`

@ref akn:art_154
GIVEN `agreed` IS A BOOLEAN, `day` IS A DATE, `agreed in the supreme follow-up committee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `outcome of section 154`
DECIDE `updating linked amounts` `agreed` `day` `agreed in the supreme follow-up committee` IS
    IF `agreed` OR `agreed in the supreme follow-up committee`
    THEN `updated at the rate and dates agreed`
    ELSE IF `day` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2009)
         THEN `each side keeps its claims`
         ELSE `still under negotiation`

#ASSERT `updating linked amounts` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2009) FALSE EQUALS `each side keeps its claims`
#ASSERT `updating linked amounts` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 2009) FALSE EQUALS `still under negotiation`
